    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Omnious",
      "uuid": "41bd4ab8cb004e1db4dc36e57c2c6a8a",
      "x": 1765.2642774791416,
      "y": -79.56345177573769,
      "width": 1080.874108362932,
      "height": 450.39874030858067,
      "z_value": 10.0,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "\nHere's the full analysis \u2014 **top 10 most repeated patterns** across the codebase, ranked by frequency and extraction value:\n\n| **2** | **Paint data grid** (header \u2192 divider \u2192 label/value rows \u2192 footer) | 3 | `paint_data_grid(painter, rect, header, rows, fonts, colors)` |\n| **3** | **QTimer creation** (new \u2192 interval \u2192 connect \u2192 start) | ~14 | `create_timer(interval, callback, single_shot=False)` |\n| **4** | **Font with max(1, size) clamp** | 20+ | `make_font(family=None, size=None, bold=False)` |\n| **5** | **QPen / QBrush from theme color** | 30+ | `make_pen(color, width=1, style=SolidLine)` / `make_brush(color)` |\n| **6** | **Closest port search** (identical loop in input + output variants) | 4 | `closest_port(ports, scene_pos)` |\n| **8** | **Inset rect from padding/offsets** | 20+ | `inset_rect(base, top, bottom, left, right)` |\n| **9** | **QPropertyAnimation boilerplate** | 12+ | `create_animation(target, prop, start, end, duration, easing)` |\n\nKey observations:\n- Patterns 4 and 5 are the lowest-hanging fruit \u2014 one-liners that eliminate `max(1, ...)` and `QPen(QColor(...))` noise everywhere.\n- Pattern 2 (data grid painting) is higher complexity but would clean up the three monitor nodes significantly.\n"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Gentle",
      "uuid": "42df6c118b3b4639953c7740c4c26bc9",
      "x": 2106.3191557459763,
      "y": -1284.2075683453395,
      "width": 273.8429402633333,
      "height": 120.0,
      "z_value": 10.0,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Segoe UI'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">And that's how we get sweetums cookies</p></body></html>"
    },
